  "generated_text": "1. **Calculate the product inside the square root:**\n   \\[\n   (31)(30)(29)(28) = 24,360\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   24,360 + 1 = 24,361\n   \\]\n\n2. **Find the square root of 24,361:**\n   \\[\n   \\sqrt{24,361} = 156\n   \\]\n\n3. **Conclusion:**\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{156}\n   \\]",
